msgstr "Désactiver appareil brouillage\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_008"
msgid "Retire Presidential clone\\n"
msgstr "Eliminer le clone du Président\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_009"
msgid "Locate and rescue President\\n"
msgstr "Trouver et sauver le Président\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_010"
msgid "There's the escape pod.\\n"
msgstr "Voilà le point d'évacuation. \\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_011"
msgid "Maybe there's a beacon in there.\\n"
msgstr "Le signal peut venir de là. \\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_012"
msgid "The jamming... It's coming from that ship.\\n"
msgstr "Le brouillage... Il vient de ce vaisseau. \\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_013"
msgid "Elvis... He'll be able to protect the President.\\n"
msgstr "Elvis... Il pourra protéger le Président.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_014"
msgid "Distress beacon has been activated.\\n"
msgstr "Signal de détresse activé.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_015"
msgid "Critical mission object has been destroyed.\\n"
msgstr "Objet crucial détruit.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_016"
msgid "Obtain Presidential Scanner.\\n"
msgstr "Obtenir le scanner présidentiel.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_017"
msgid "\\n"
msgstr "\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_018"
msgid "\\n"
msgstr "\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_019"
msgid "A Presidential Scanner\\n"
msgstr "Un Scanner présidentiel\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_020"
msgid "Picked up a Presidential Scanner.\\n"
msgstr "Scanner présidentiel obtenu.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_021"
msgid "Jamming device has been shut down.\\n"
msgstr "Appareil de brouillage désactivé.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_022"
msgid "President has been killed.\\n"
msgstr "Le Président a été abattu.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_023"
msgid "Presidential clone has been eliminated.\\n"
msgstr "Clone présidentiel éliminé.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_024"
msgid "You'll never save him now!\\n"
msgstr "Vous ne pourrez pas le sauver!\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_025"
msgid "President has been rescued.\\n"
msgstr "Président sauvé.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_026"
msgid "Obtain Night Vision.\\n"
msgstr "Obtenir Vue nocturne.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_027"
msgid "Cassandra De Vries'\\n"
msgstr "Cassandra De Vries: \\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_028"
msgid "Night Vision\\n"
msgstr "Vue nocturne\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_029"
msgid "Night Vision\\n"
msgstr "Vue nocturne\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_030"
msgid "Picked up Night Vision.\\n"
msgstr "Vue nocturne obtenue.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_031"
msgid "Take this; you should find it useful!\\n"
msgstr "Prends ceci. Cela te sera utile!\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_032"
msgid "Ahhh... uuhhhh...\\n"
msgstr "Ahhh... oohhhh...\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_033"
msgid "Ahhh... uhh... owww...\\n"
msgstr "Ahhh... ohh... ouuuuhhh...\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_034"
msgid "Agent Dark! Please report!\\n"
msgstr "Agent Dark! Quel est votre statut?\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_035"
msgid "Perfect Dark, come in!\\n"
msgstr "Perfect Dark, répondez!\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_036"
msgid "A-agent Dark reporting in...\\n"
msgstr "A-agent Dark au rapport...\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_037"
msgid "Agent Dark! Please reply!\\n"
msgstr "Agent Dark! Parlez bon sang!\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_038"
msgid ""
"Something's jamming my transmissions... It's coming from that other "
"craft.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Quelque chose brouille mes transmissions... Cela vient peut-être de l'autre "
"appareil.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_039"
msgid ""
"I'd better find the jamming device and check that Elvis is okay. Not "
"forgetting the President, of course.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Je ferais mieux de trouver la source du brouillage et m'assurer qu'Elvis est"
" en bonne santé. Sans oublier le Président...\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_040"
msgid "How are you feeling, Mr. President?\\n"
msgstr "Comment vous sentez-vous, M. le Président?\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_041"
msgid ""
"Better now, young lady. Today, I think, will take a while for me to get "
"over. I can't believe Easton would do such a thing. I knew he was ambitious,"
" yes, but this...\\n"
msgstr ""
"Mieux. Merci mon petit. Je me souviendrai de cette journée. Comment Easton "
"a-t-il pu faire une chose pareille? Je le savais ambitieux, mais tout "
"ceci...\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_042"
msgid ""
"Just one thing, sir? What is the Pelagic II that Trent wanted so badly?\\n"
msgstr ""
"Une question, monsieur. Qu'est-ce que le Pelagic II, cette chose que Trent "
"cherchait?\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_043"
msgid ""
"It's a U.S. government deep sea research vessel, one of a kind... The only "
"ship that can conduct a full-scale diving operation at extreme depth. Trent "
"wanted me to loan it to the dataDyne Corporation, but I refused.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Un vaisseau de recherche sous-marin du gouvernement américain. Un modèle "
"unique pouvant mener des expériences à de grandes profondeurs. Trent a "
"formulé une demande de prêt au nom de la dataDyne Corporation. J'ai "
"refusé.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_044"
msgid "Trent has a lot to answer for, but I don't think we'll find him now.\\n"
msgstr "Trent devra répondre de ses actes. Encore faut-il le trouver.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_045"
msgid ""
"You have failed, Easton. You are a flawed device, and we need you no "
"longer.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Vous avez échoué, Easton. Vous êtes un élément corrompu. Nous nous passerons"
" de vous.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_046"
msgid "Just try it, you Scandinavian freak!\\n"
msgstr "C'est ça oui. Pétasse suédoise, va!\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_047"
msgid "Noooooooo!!!\\n"
msgstr "Noooooooon!!!\\n"
